    <div class="litrow step"><span class="n">\ 01</span><h4>Listen</h4><p>Before a single deliverable, I find what you actually stand for. Most brands are too close to see it. That gap is where the work begins.</p></div>
    <div class="litrow step"><span class="n">\ 02</span><h4>Frame</h4><p>Strategy and creative direction, set at the senior level. We decide what the work needs to say and how it should feel, then lock the thinking.</p></div>
